[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 \r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28 Wireframing: -wireframe mode is in effect for window moves.\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   If this yields undesired behavior (poor response, painting\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   errors, etc) it may be disabled:\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28    - use '-nowf' to disable wireframing completely.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28    - use '-nowcr' to disable the Copy Rectangle after the\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28      moved window is released in the new position.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28   Also see the -help entry for tuning parameters.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28   You can press 3 Alt_L's (Left \"Alt\" key) in a row to \r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   repaint the screen, also see the -fixscreen option for\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   periodic repaints.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 \r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28 XFIXES available on display, resetting cursor mode\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   to: '-cursor most'.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28   to disable this behavior use: '-cursor arrow'\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   or '-noxfixes'.\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28 using XFIXES for cursor drawing.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 GrabServer control via XTEST.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 XKEYBOARD: number of keysyms per keycode 7 is greater\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28   than 4 and 51 keysyms are mapped above 4.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28   Automatically switching to -xkb mode.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28   If this makes the key mapping worse you can\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   disable it with the \"-noxkb\" option.\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28   Also, remember \"-remap DEAD\" for accenting characters.\r\n11/08/2026 16:42:28 \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 X FBPM extension not supported.\r\nXlib:  extension \"DPMS\" missing on display \":99\".\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 X display is not capable of DPMS.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11/08/2026 16:42:28 --------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
